      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "传道这种事是圣人的工作，\n无法自己开拓道路的人也就到此为止了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "188a5960a9b876687c518cb9653b04b86c48f3fd48858b285e5f09fcc7b7c540",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
